# Project rules

- Run application commands from `app/`.
- Use Biome for linting and formatting.
- Keep changes focused and add tests for behavior changes.
- Prefer simple, readable code and preserve the existing architecture.
- Never commit credentials, local settings, logs, presentation data, signing
  material, or generated release artifacts.
